<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1874949721"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:33.678"><div begin="21.211" end="49.496" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="21.211" end="27.735" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.211" end="21.790">你说</span><span begin="21.790" end="22.226">我</span><span begin="22.226" end="22.512">们</span><span begin="22.512" end="22.915">两</span><span begin="22.915" end="24.024">个</span> <span begin="24.867" end="25.391">终究</span><span begin="25.391" end="25.794">不</span><span begin="25.794" end="26.566">太适</span><span begin="26.566" end="27.735">合</span></p><p begin="28.467" end="33.651" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.467" end="29.067">退后</span><span begin="29.067" end="29.466">一</span><span begin="29.466" end="29.698">步</span><span begin="29.698" end="30.158">回</span><span begin="30.158" end="30.509">到</span><span begin="30.820" end="31.570">各自</span><span begin="31.570" end="32.069">的</span><span begin="32.069" end="32.463">生</span><span begin="32.463" end="33.651">活</span></p><p begin="35.762" end="42.246" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.762" end="36.343">于是</span><span begin="36.343" end="36.792">我</span><span begin="36.792" end="36.995">没</span><span begin="36.995" end="37.494">反</span><span begin="37.494" end="38.305">驳</span> <span begin="39.429" end="39.939">装作</span><span begin="39.939" end="40.388">足</span><span begin="40.388" end="40.602">够</span><span begin="40.602" end="41.111">洒</span><span begin="41.111" end="42.246">脱</span></p><p begin="43.053" end="49.496" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.053" end="43.570">而你</span><span begin="43.570" end="44.012">转</span><span begin="44.012" end="44.692">身之</span><span begin="44.692" end="45.183">后</span><span begin="45.400" end="46.147">和他</span><span begin="46.147" end="46.871">牵</span><span begin="46.871" end="47.056">了</span><span begin="47.056" end="49.496">手</span></p></div><div begin="50.186" end="1:07.602" itunes:songPart="Verse"><